## Datasets

### Production complaints dataset
- Internal pre-existing labeled Arabic restaurant complaints.
- Used for training and as primary source of test/val data.

### Google Play scraped reviews
- Public reviews of Saudi food delivery apps (HungerStation, Jahez, Mrsool, Talabat).
- Scraped via google-play-scraper Python package. All reviews were already publicly visible at the time of scraping.

### RES1 negative reviews
- Subset of large-arabic-sentiment dataset, negative-polarity subset, keyword-filtered for ambiance content.
- Used during 9-class training; rows were removed when the ambiance category was dropped.

### ChatGPT-generated synthetic
- ~2,000 dialectal Saudi-Gulf ambiance complaints generated externally via OpenAI GPT-4o.
- Used during 9-class training; rows were removed when the ambiance category was dropped.

